WEBVTT

00:00:57.605 --> 00:01:01.990
And her abuser was incredibly
technologically sophisticated:

00:01:02.014 --> 00:01:06.602
new images and new videos every few weeks,

00:01:06.626 --> 00:01:10.675
but very few clues as to who she was

00:01:10.699 --> 00:01:12.375
or where she was.

00:01:13.324 --> 00:01:14.710
And so they called us,

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.424
because they had heard
we were a new nonprofit

00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:20.906
building technology
to fight child sexual abuse.

00:01:21.596 --> 00:01:23.883
But we were only two years old,

00:01:23.907 --> 00:01:27.039
and we had only worked
on child sex trafficking.

00:01:27.944 --> 00:01:30.067
And I had to tell them